Pushing a new line to this file fires .github/workflows/telegram.yml through
its `push` trigger. It exists only because the GitHub App connected to
this repo has "contents: write" but not "actions: write" — a plain commit
here is what a workflow_dispatch call would otherwise be used for, and
telegram.yml's own "*/5 * * * *" cron is confirmed unreliable for this repo.

